zeros -- List the zeros of a polynomial
***************************************

  * Usage: 
        zeros p
        zeros(F, p)
  * Inputs:
      * p, a polynomial
      * F, the coefficient field; if not specified then it is taken to be the
        field of definition of p
  * Outputs:
      * a *note list: (Macaulay2Doc)List, of zeros of p in the coefficient
        field

Description
===========

Get a *note list: (Macaulay2Doc)List, of zeros of a polynomial using *note
factor: (Macaulay2Doc)factor,, baby version of *note rationalPoints:
rationalPoints,.

+------------------------------------------------------+
|i1 : QQ[x]; p = (x-2)^2 * (x^2-2) * (x^3-x-1); zeros p|
|                                                      |
|o3 = {2}                                              |
|                                                      |
|o3 : List                                             |
+------------------------------------------------------+
|i4 : F = toField(QQ[q]/(q^2-2)); zeros_F p            |
|                                                      |
|o5 = {2, q, -q}                                       |
|                                                      |
|o5 : List                                             |
+------------------------------------------------------+
|i6 : F = splittingField p; #zeros_F p                 |
|                                                      |
|o7 = 6                                                |
+------------------------------------------------------+

Note that when the degree is big, the expression of each zero in terms of a
primitive element is usually complicated.

+-----------------------------------------------------------------------------+
|i8 : last zeros_F p                                                          |
|                                                                             |
|          2918037   11      43736   10     176511427  9     1742239  8       |
|o8 = - ------------a   + ----------a   + ------------a  - ----------a  -     |
|       194598748990      3926880585      194598748990     2617920390         |
|     ------------------------------------------------------------------------|
|      7776041337  7    54520588  6    38282000079 5    50576753 4            |
|     ------------a  + ----------a  + ------------a  - ---------a  -          |
|     389197497980     3926880585     194598748990     436320065              |
|     ------------------------------------------------------------------------|
|     382379122373 3   1544138762 2   456488667029     137345843              |
|     ------------a  + ----------a  + ------------a + ----------              |
|     389197497980     3926880585     389197497980    1308960195              |
|                                                                             |
|o8 : F                                                                       |
+-----------------------------------------------------------------------------+
|i9 : (map(F, ring p, {oo})) p                                                |
|                                                                             |
|o9 = 0                                                                       |
|                                                                             |
|o9 : F                                                                       |
+-----------------------------------------------------------------------------+

Over finite fields.

+--------------------------------------+
|i10 : q = baseChange_13 p; zeros q    |
|                                      |
|o11 = {2}                             |
|                                      |
|o11 : List                            |
+--------------------------------------+
|i12 : F = splittingField q; describe F|
|                                      |
|o13 = GF 4826809                      |
+--------------------------------------+
|i14 : #zeros_F q                      |
|                                      |
|o14 = 6                               |
+--------------------------------------+

